@startuml roadmap-model
title Roadmap 视图模型 (/roadmap)
' Delta 链（文档）：model → component；为可预览，不内容 include 异构图
hide circle
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0

class RoadmapPageViewModel {
  templateUpdateAvailable: boolean
}

class RoadmapSummaryVM {
  roadmapId: UUID
  title: string
  status: string
}

class RoadmapTaskRowVM {
  taskId: UUID
  status: string
  actionability: string
  origin: string
  version: int
}

class RoadmapTaskDetailVM {
  taskId: UUID
  completionCriteria: string
}

class TaskDependencyVM {
  dependsOnTaskId: UUID
  state: string
}

RoadmapPageViewModel *-- RoadmapSummaryVM
RoadmapPageViewModel *-- RoadmapTaskRowVM
RoadmapTaskRowVM --> RoadmapTaskDetailVM
RoadmapTaskDetailVM *-- TaskDependencyVM

note right of RoadmapTaskRowVM
  status: TODO / IN_PROGRESS / COMPLETED / ARCHIVED
  actionability: ACTIONABLE / BLOCKED / UNSCHEDULED
  Task status != Action status
  Roadmap does not persist Action
end note

@enduml
